WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:04.680
<i>Caught in a battle between homunculi</i> <i>and an alchemist warrior,</i>

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.410
<i>Kazuki Muto's heart is pierced</i> <i>and he loses his life.</i>

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.450
Oh, no! l've gotten him involved!

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.960
<i>Kazuki receives a new life from</i> <i>the alchemist warrior Tokiko,</i>

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.550
<i>and has a kakugane implanted</i> <i>into his heart.</i>

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.990
<i>He is presented with</i> <i>a choice of how to use that life.</i>

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.360
lt'll be your normal world if you turn back.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.230
lt'll be a world of battle if you come.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.300
You should know which world it is you belong in

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.770
without my saying it, right?

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:37.840
<i>lnstead, Kazuki makes a third choice</i> <i>and activates his new power.</i>

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:50.780
You! What about your little sister?!

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.320
lt's okay. l made sure to take her home!

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.930
l ran full speed for thirty minutes.
But l've still got lots of energy.

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:00.540
You're at your limit.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.860
Why did you come?! l told you not to.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:06.710
l have the power to fight that you gave me.

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:11.940
<i>Kazuki has received a new life</i> <i>as well as a new power.</i>

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:16.550
<i>He chooses to battle the homunculi together</i> <i>with the alchemist warrior Tokiko.</i>

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:23.000
<i>The True Form Homunculus</i>

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.440
Mita and Saruwatari?

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:33.680
Yes. lt seems the lab has been destroyed

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:37.340
and we've lost communications with the homunculi that were holed up there.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.920
An alchemist warrior, huh?

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.350
There can be no other explanation.

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:49.130
l see. Then we must go greet them ourselves...

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:26.560
What's this?

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:29.800
To...

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:32.060
Tokiko Tsumura.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.910
There's a girl's name in Kazuki's cell phone!

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.110
You're lewd, Okakura!

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.240
So he's lewd...Okakura's a perv.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:44.810
Okakura the perv...

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:45.910
Okakura's a pervert.

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.210
Noooo!

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.290
That's what you get for looking at someone's cell phone without asking...

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.160
Oh...Tokiko.

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.860
Yeah...l sort of can't shake the tiredness.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:02.730
But, yeah...l'm okay.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.300
Whoa. lt doesn't seem to be an imaginary girlfriend.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.470
Darn it. He's all into sweet strawberry talk.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.470
Strawberry.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.510
What's he talking about?

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:17.180
lt seems they're going to meet at the haunted factory after school.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.340
You can hear him?

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:19.050
No...

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.380
l'm lip-reading.

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.210
What <i>are</i> you, man?!

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.060
What're you doing?

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:39.640
Tokiko.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:40.460
Let's go.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:41.210
Right...

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:46.710
l took it upon myself to bury the bodies of the victims.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:47.710
l wonder if that was okay.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:51.640
l don't think it's a bad thing to accord the dead every courtesy.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:55.390
Yeah, but l mean like informing the police or something...

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.990
That's not my mission.

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.820
My mission is to fight.

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.620
Besides, the police can't resolve this matter.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:12.160
All they can do is identify the bodies, but that can be done after the resolution.

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:15.800
The first thing we have to do is...

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:19.580
Yeah, l thought about that, too!

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:24.810
First of all, we need to give my lance a cool name!

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:26.540
One, Super Ultra...

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.920
Special Strong Muscle DX!

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.850
Two, Dragonfly Cutter 2006!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.520
Three, simply, "Spear"!

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.790
Four, defying expectations, "Sword"!

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:37.020
So, which one should it be?

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.930
Something like that can be done even later still!

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:41.900
First we need to identify and then search for the enemy!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:45.270
Here l went to the trouble of thinking all night...

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.470
So <i>that's</i> why you can't shake your tiredness?!

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:48.900
Make sure you get enough sleep!

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:51.140
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:55.610
l checked out this area while you were at school.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:00.410
What's this?

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.890
lt's an incubator l found underground for a homunculus embryo.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.590
Embryo?

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.390
Created with the cells of living organisms as the base.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.370
They're fragile things...

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:23.410
three centimeters in size that won't last a day

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:26.240
outside this narrow confined space of a tightly sealed flask.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:32.010
However, when that fragile embryo lodges itself within a person's brain,

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:35.850
it sucks away the flesh, alters the entire body

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.860
and morphs into an unyielding man-eating monster,

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.950
while emulating the organism that became its base.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:42.420
Then...

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.990
Mita and Saruwatari were shadows of their former selves.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:50.630
One victim for each body, and even more for food...

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.470
Victims everywhere...

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:53.440
That's right.

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:55.070
Knowing all of this,

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.700
there was somebody who conducted experiments on them

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.110
and created these monsters here.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:07.480
The only thing that can stop them is our Buso Renkin.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:16.060
Say, Tokiko...

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:22.770
l wonder who the heck was doing research on the monsters here...

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:24.530
And for what purpose?

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:33.880
One high school boy and girl,

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.440
and the girl is wearing a uniform l've never seen before.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:39.750
The boy wears a uniform from the same school as you, Master.

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:41.740
Should we attack?

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.550
l have the confidence to take them down even from here.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:49.150
No, let us approach in a more friendly way.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:58.340
Someone living in this area is involved in alchemy.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.410
lt's possible to guess what their purpose is,

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.740
but we can't say for sure at this stage.

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:11.020
What we can say for sure is that the creator doesn't respect life.

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:15.080
They'll do whatever it takes if it's for the sake of their own research...

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.360
Tokiko!

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.100
Don't touch me!

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.500
lt's been repelled.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:31.700
Too bad.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:36.230
l thought we'd be able to do some kakugane research if we got close.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.370
But it can't be helped.

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:40.310
Washio... Attack.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:47.480
Up above!

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:56.620
Buso Renkin!

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:02.600
He's coming!

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.060
Fire your lance into the sky!

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:04.540
What?!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.870
With the power of that Buso Renkin it should reach before him!

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:08.840
B-But...

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.780
The Buso Renkin is a part of oneself emitted from one's fighting instinct.

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.110
You can definitely handle it!
Have faith!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:15.910
Got it.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.920
Pierce through, my Buso Renkin!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.350
Evade!

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:30.220
l won't let you get away!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:35.830
I'll be darned.
This is an alchemist warrior, huh?

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.560
Valkyrie Skirt!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:41.670
He's fast.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.800
Are you okay, Master?

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:45.580
Yes.

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:49.510
We can't take that
Death Scythe girl lightly.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.210
And the other one, the boy with the lance!

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.050
<i>l've found a clue.</i>

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.660
<i>That student uniform,</i> <i>it's a guy from the same school as Kazuki!</i>

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.860
Are you okay, Tokiko?!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:07.590
Tokiko!

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:16.870
You okay?

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.640
Y-Yeah.

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:25.670
There were a total of twenty incubators underground...

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.450
We defeated sixteen homunculi last night.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.790
Add in that impudent embryo l repelled earlier...

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:37.250
there are three homunculi enemies and... the Creator in the papillon mask left.

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:40.860
The three remaining are most likely there to safeguard the Creator.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:42.060
lt's not going to be easy.

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.630
Yeah... But we have to win!

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:49.740
That's right. The Buso Renkin was created to exterminate them.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:53.030
We definitely won't lose.
We'll beat them no matter what!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.180
We can't just beat them.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.750
We can't allow any more victims.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:00.320
l think that's what it means to beat them!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:03.690
l'm going to put my hands together in prayer one more time at the grave.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:08.420
<i>He makes the most difficult thing</i> <i>sound so easy.</i>

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:10.290
<i>However...</i>

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:11.790
Wait.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:15.430
I'll go with you.

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:20.370
That was really something back there. l wonder what in the world that was.

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.640
Hmm. A plastic bottle rocket?

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:24.780
l wonder.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.340
More importantly, let's get going.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:28.880
You jerk, Kazuki!

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:31.180
l won't let you get the jump on me! lntroduce me!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.120
But is it true?

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.950
ls my big brother really meeting a woman in such a place?

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.990
I'll catch them strawberrying on the spot!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:56.700
Kazuki.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.580
What is it, Tokiko?

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.770
You've obtained power.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:01.350
Right!

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:05.850
However, that alone will not be enough to prevent more victims.

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:10.690
lf you're saying you don't want any more victims,

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:14.920
then it's necessary for you to fully command your Buso Renkin.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:18.490
Oh, there he is.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:21.400
Hey, Big Brother!

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.100
Did you say you were coming here?

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:25.230
No, l didn't say anything.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:29.800
Oh, well. Deal with it as you see fit.
I'll leave.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:32.210
What the heck are you doing in a place like?

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:34.770
Oh! lt's true.
My big brother's got a girlfriend!

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:35.540
Huh?!

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.540
Kazuki!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:39.620
Whaaat?!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.020
Congratulations.

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:42.290
Treat us to something.

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:44.860
Hey, since when, since when?

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:46.850
Huh? Girlfriend?

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:48.390
Wh-What?!

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:53.130
l see. l'm your <i>girlfriend</i>, huh?

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.640
We're very sorry.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:06.210
But, then what are you to Kazuki?

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:09.240
Siblings!

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:14.090
Big sister? l don't know you! l don't know you!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.690
But you have a different last name, so you're my big step-sister.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:20.720
Arggh, that's irritating!

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:23.060
Don't you have some kind of better cover?

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:27.260
Hmm... Something else l could come up with is a teacher or...

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:28.490
a rival or something...

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:33.070
Kazuki and her, a teacher...

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:36.140
<i>Which means</i> <i>she and l are also...</i>

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:37.870
<i>Older Brother - Younger Sister</i>

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.110
<i>Older Sister - Younger Brother</i>

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.070
<i>Older Sister - Younger Sister</i>

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:45.140
Ohhhh! l don't get what's going on!

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:48.210
Darn it! l envy you, Kazuki!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.180
<i>Kazuki and the girlfriend are rivals,</i> <i>but written as friends...</i>

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.620
What? So <i>that</i> was it?!

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:58.220
lt's kind of like imagination giving rise to imagination...

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:00.570
lt's all for the best!

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:04.300
Listen, why don't we go for some tea or something

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:06.740
instead of standing here talking in a place like this?

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:08.000
Oh, that's right.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:12.010
lt seems we need to get an account of the situation, so.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:14.580
No, l...

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.910
Okay, let's go.

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:24.950
Alright, then let's all get moving!

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:33.400
Tokiko?

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.170
We've run into some trouble.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.960
l should've sliced it to pieces instead of repelling it.

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.770
Hello? You there, Kawazui?

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:50.210
<i>Ayeee, l'm waiting nearby</i> <i>just as you bid me, Master.</i>

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:55.820
Ayeee, l understand. l launch a follow up attack, right?

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:58.390
<i>However, there is no need</i> <i>to pursue too far.</i>

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:02.620
Then I'll use the kids this time around.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.010
I'll take it out.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.540
I'll help, too.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.180
No. You stay out of it.

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:30.720
We have to finish this without anyone picking up on the situation.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.220
Where shall we go?

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:34.490
Hmm, let's see.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:35.390
Should we go to that place

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.020
—by the train station?
—if we fail we'll end up...

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.650
dragging them into danger.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:43.330
There'll be nothing we can do about it once the embryo invades the brain.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:47.260
Those seized have their minds killed, their flesh taken

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:49.500
and they become man-eating creatures going berserk.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:54.140
And you can't yet activate your
Buso Renkin silently and without movement.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.750
Buso Renkin.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:59.950
Your only attack is a full-strength powerful technique.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:04.820
You don't yet have total command of the Buso Renkin.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:17.430
My Valkryie Skirt is accurate and quick.
Four arms for four targets.

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:21.030
l can catch it no matter who is targeted!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.570
Now, which way will it jump?!

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.210
lt moved!

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:28.840
lt's coming for me?!

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:30.110
Tokiko!

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:33.410
<i>We have to finish this without anyone</i> <i>picking up on the situation.</i>

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:36.780
<i>lf we fail,</i> w <i>e'll end up</i> <i>dragging them into danger.</i>

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.190
Darn it.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:40.620
Huh?

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:43.820
Big Brother?

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.390
Escaped, have they?

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:49.290
Kaaazuki!

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:51.670
l wonder where they went.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:55.030
But you know, l wonder who that person is.

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:56.000
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:01.680
<i>l get the feeling l heard</i> <i>that person's voice somewhere recently.</i>

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.010
Ow! Ow! Ow...!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.490
That looks like a really big owee!

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:08.850
But...!

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:25.960
So you're finally awake, huh?
The sun set ages ago.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:27.800
Any injuries?

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:31.010
You've got bruises all over your body.

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:37.880
Oweeeeeeeeeee...!

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:42.680
l'm fine. Thanks to you, l'm not hurt.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.820
What about the homunculus embryo?

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:50.520
lt's okay. Thanks to you, l was able to avert penetration into the brain.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:57.000
Oh...

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:07.440
l'm sorry...

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:11.880
Why are you apologizing?
You've done nothing wrong.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.420
Even so, l'm sorry...

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:22.090
Don't apologize. ln fact, you did well...

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:26.330
lf it had been your little sister or your friends getting inhabited,

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.030
there would've been no turning back...

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.130
The same goes for you...

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:36.230
l've had it with making you put your life in danger more than once.

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:42.100
Anyway, now we have to take care of our business

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:46.120
before this pesky little devil climbs up to my head.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:48.650
You'll be okay!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.950
lf there were no such outlook,

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:54.650
l would've taken care of myself before you woke up.

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.560
At this distance, it'll probably take a week

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:01.230
for the embryo to reach the brain from the body.

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.600
By then, we have to defeat

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:06.160
the three homunculi monsters standing in the way

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:08.870
and capture the Creator in the papillon mask,

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:11.000
the only one who can cure the embryo.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:16.540
lf we don't make it in time,
I'll turn into a homunculus...

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.920
At that time, you are to kill me.

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:27.880
That's how it'll be, so...

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:31.720
We don't have the time to take things easy!

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:32.590
We'll make the first move.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:35.960
Busou...!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.070
This thing's getting in the way!

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:40.830
Tokiko!

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:52.150
<i>Buso Renkin activation silently</i> <i>and without movement...?</i>

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.410
Stay away from Tokiko!

00:18:59.120 --> 00:18:59.890
What?!

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.260
<i>This is bad...</i>

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:06.160
<i>His lance Buso Renkin is ill-suited</i> <i>for small movements as it is.</i>

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:10.700
<i>Yes. He can still only use</i> <i>his main powerful technique.</i>

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.270
<i>However...</i>

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.340
<i>Where he is now...</i>

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:28.050
Pierce through, my Buso Renkin!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:50.270
Does it hurt, Tokiko?
But be patient for just a week.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:59.110
I'll master this lance in a week, no matter what,

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:02.420
and capture the creator in the papillon mask!

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:18.320
I'll turn into a homunculus in a week, at this rate...

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:21.380
When that happens, you are to kill me.

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:25.160
Next time, "You've Become a Little Stronger"

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:27.230
I'll splatter your guts out!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:36.170
Mahiro's Buso Renkin Seminar!

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:42.930
Mahiro's Buso Renkin Seminar, starts now!

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:50.140
Starting from today l, Mahiro Muto,

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.980
will be introducing various Buso Renkin to the viewers!

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:55.290
Kicking off to celebrate our very first seminar

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:59.380
is Kazuki Muto's Buso Renkin, the Sunlightheart!

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:05.490
As you all know,
Kazuki Muto is super clutzy to the bone,

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.870
holding a very strong sense of justice and he's very caring of his friends!

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:10.840
l'm proud to have him as my big brother!

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:14.710
But his good nature is also what caused him

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:16.870
to get killed by the Homunculus.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:20.270
Fortunately, Big Brother came back to life

00:21:20.350 --> 00:21:23.340
thanks to Tokiko implanting a kakugane as a replacement for the heart.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.420
And using that kakugane,

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:28.460
Big Brother made the vow to fight in order to protect everyone.

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:34.890
So, my big brother's Buso Renkin is a charging lance.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.260
lt's very fitting for my always-so-reckless big brother!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:42.500
Wielding this lance, he charges into enemy hands with a bang!

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:44.330
But the ornamental cloth attached to the lance

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.600
is what really makes this Buso Renkin special.

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:50.880
The ornamental cloth responds to the bearer and energizes itself,

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:54.180
emanating a beautiful orange color.

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:59.590
Seeing it, Tokiko gave it the name "Sunlightheart."

00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:02.790
Big Brother also came up with various names,

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:06.490
but l think Sunlightheart is a very nice name.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:10.360
Although he is still no match against Tokiko,

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:13.300
my big brother is actually very reliable!

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:16.570
lt's because Big Brother is there for everyone!

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:20.140
Okie dokie, tune in for next time!

00:22:23.710 --> 00:22:26.150
Mahiro Illustration by: Taeko Hori

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:29.120
